/-!
# Dyda's inequality (13) for the unit ball

B. Dyda, *On comparability of integral forms*, J. Math. Anal. Appl. 318(2) (2006) 564–577,
DOI 10.1016/j.jmaa.2005.06.021, inequality (13) in the proof of Theorem 1 (p. 572) — the input
Bux–Kassmann–Schulze quote in Lemma A.1. It was carried here as an unproved statement; it is now
proved in `QuadraticFormsSobolev/Dyda/` (`Dyda.lintegral_le_regional_unitBall`), following Dyda's
Step 1 and replacing his Step 2 by a chaining through the pulled-in midpoint.
-/
